                <descriptionOfRestrictions xml:lang="en">Delivery to Geneva or Basel (650 km by rail and 150 km by road), and distribution in CH (100 km by rail and 150 km by road). Surveys for distribution mainly for DE and CH.</descriptionOfRestrictions>
