        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Distribution of fuels\n\n# Included processes\nThis dataset includes the transport of (rye-based) anhydrous ethanol from distilleries in RER to Switzerland (600 km by rail, 150 km by truck), and distribution to the end user (100 km by rail and 150 km by road). Operation of storage tanks and fuel station is included. Emissions from evaporation and treatment of effluents are also included.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
